  "title": "· FENDI Butterfly Sequin Baguette ·",
  "original_title": "FENDI 蝶翼亮片 Baguette 法棍包",
  "excerpt": "Fendi's Pre-Spring 2025 Baguette bag features shimmering sequin embroidery inspired by butterfly wing patterns.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-01-09",
