    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This vibrant Baguette bag from FENDI's Pre-Spring 2025 collection takes design cues from the dazzling patterns of butterfly wings. Using intricate embroidery, shimmering sequins are layered across the bag to form the \"Night Butterfly\" motif, capturing the graceful, fluttering allure of butterflies.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cqy0o60/3fa19a1f5428f450.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cqy0o60/3fa19a1f5428f450.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Night Butterfly Sequined Embroidery ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI's Pre-Spring 2025 collection is inspired by the theme of the \"Social Butterfly.\" Creative Director Silvia Venturini Fendi draws from 1980s disco culture, weaving together vibrant hues like turquoise, tangerine, slate blue, and burgundy, alongside abstract prints such as polka dots and tiger moth patterns, for a romantic yet opulent aesthetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "FENDI Pre-Spring 2025 Collection (Swipe left/right to browse more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Baguette is entirely adorned with the \"Night Butterfly\" wing motif—thousands of sequins are layered via embroidery across the bag, creating a shimmering effect that dances in sunlight or artificial light, evoking the enchanting image of butterflies fluttering in the sun.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for a crystal-clear visual experience.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Upon closer inspection, the left upper flap features dense embroidery of large gold sequins that naturally transition into fresh turquoise sequins on the right, with mottled brown sequins interspersed like spots on a butterfly's wing. The bag's body is outlined with black and white sequins forming irregular dot patterns that extend to the sides... The entire bag resembles a finely crafted embroidery piece, with its resplendent colors creating a dreamy, almost magical visual effect.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
