    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The clasp base, handle, and strap details feature the \"Peppered Falena\" moth wing pattern—set against a dark brown calfskin background, orange teardrop-shaped polka dots are spread across it, serving as the bag's finishing touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
