    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Left: Still from *Sex and the City* (2000) / Right: Still from the 2021 revival *And Just Like That…*",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The handbag features a rectangular silhouette with a clean flap design. The sleek, iconic \"FF\" clasp is the most recognizable design element on this bag, here crafted in polished gold-tone metal. The magnetic snap closure allows for one-handed access, making it incredibly convenient and practical.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
