      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic FF logo was created in 1967 by the late Creative Director Karl Lagerfeld, representing the concept of \"Fun Fur.\" Since the words FENDI, Fun, and Fur all start with the same letter, Karl sketched the FF motif in just five seconds.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cqy0o60/8eb5fa5bd2d41342.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cqy0o60/c42370b4674f1b62.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Strap & Handle ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer equipped this Baguette with two accessories—a 100cm wide shoulder strap and a 46cm handle, both detachable.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
