    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Baguette is a medium size, easily complementing different body types. We fit a phone, card case, keys, notebook, and touch-up makeup inside. The dazzling sequins infuse the bag with an opulent party vibe, making it the perfect statement piece for any celebration.",
