    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Baguette Medium Handbag / Designer: Silvia Venturini Fendi / Size: 27cm long, 15cm high, 6cm deep / Weight: 490g / Retail price ¥34,000",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fendi is a renowned Italian leather goods and fur brand founded in 1925 by Adele Casagrande and Edoardo Fendi. The brand's logo, a symmetrical motif of two \"F\" letters, was created by German fashion designer and creative director Karl Lagerfeld. Since 1925 from Rome.",
      "url": null,
